9603	What are content blocks?		11.1.5
9604	Content blocks are blocks whose content you can edit. You can define one or more <em>block types</em>, and attach fields to each block type. Content blocks can be placed just like blocks provided by other modules.		11.1.5
9605	Overview for managing blocks		11.1.5
